  "description": "WordPress-Style Image Resizer for .NET\n\nResize images like WordPress with predefined sizes: Thumbnail, Medium, Large, and Full.\nSave all sizes automatically to disk with high-quality JPEG encoding.\nRetrieve any specific size easily using the ImageSize enum.\nCross-platform support using ImageSharp, maintaining aspect ratio and quality.\nPerfect for .NET apps, APIs, or CMS systems needing automated image management.",
